08. PROJECT DEMONSTRATION

Project Title

LegalEaseAI – AI-Powered Legal Document Generator

1. Introduction

The project demonstration is the final phase of the project. In this phase, the team demonstrates the complete working of LegalEaseAI and explains its purpose, features, technologies, workflow, and final output.

2. Project Introduction

Our project is called LegalEaseAI – AI-Powered Legal Document Generator.

The main purpose of this project is to help users generate structured legal document drafts using Generative AI.

3. Problem

Preparing legal documents manually can be time-consuming and difficult for users who are not familiar with legal document formats.

4. Solution

LegalEaseAI provides a simple interface where users can enter their requirements and generate a structured document using Generative AI.

5. Technologies Used

1. Python
2. FastAPI
3. Jinja2
4. HTML
5. CSS
6. Generative AI
7. GitHub

